  idleFrameRate: 12
  description: "A defensive woodland form that thrives among grass, roots and fertile ground."
  transformationMethod: "As the Mage, drink Water while covered in Grass."
  transformationPotionSprites:
  - {fileID: 8392550403479288723, guid: c46ed72b71de0254e8f156952ce6a115, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 3833926529033503733, guid: 1a1694ee82ded3342bde68515610b0d6, type: 3}
  transformationHint: "As the Mage, drink in this order."
  cureMethod: "Water while burning, or Ice under certain conditions, can return you to the Mage."
  immunePotionSprites:
  - {fileID: -5469023944784030602, guid: 531bc38a7e672414482189974260f0f8, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1834088911562275152, guid: 3bcbfe3450d294a45a466ee92b5a7219, type: 3}
  spells:
  - nome: Grass Zone
    costo: 1
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6814811798e893e49aeb69f4232536e0, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9cac0e3bc9262b945add7c7c1783ffeb, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Toggles the Grass field. Activating it replaces any other elemental field and empowers Tree. Each toggle costs mana."
    descrizionePotenziata: "Same toggle and cost. Casting while Grass is active switches the field off."
    descrizioneBreve: "Toggle the Grass field to empower Tree."
  - nome: Tree Bark
    costo: 4
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051fcadb1cfd7104db4a81008112d33f, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9cac0e3bc9262b945add7c7c1783ffeb, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Blocks the next Fire, Lava or Ice potion, then breaks. Cannot be cast while burning or while a Bark shield is already active."
    descrizionePotenziata: "With the Grass field active: the same one-hit shield also restores 2 HP when cast."
    descrizioneBreve: "Block 1 Fire, Lava or Ice hit; +2 HP in Grass."
  - nome: Overgrow
    costo: 6
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0fc91a701bc5a5b4b8616ad1e1118739, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9cac0e3bc9262b945add7c7c1783ffeb, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Summons a flower that intercepts 1 Fire, Lava, Poison or Ice potion before dying. Other potions pass through. Only one flower can be active."
    descrizionePotenziata: "With the Grass field active: summons a grown flower that intercepts 2 of those potions before dying."
    descrizioneBreve: "Grow a flower that blocks 1 harmful potion; 2 in Grass."

